{"content":[{"c":["SHEBANIAH"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. One of the seven priests assigned to blow a trumpet before the ark of God in the procession led by David, when the ark was moved to Jerusalem (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.15.24","r":"1Chr.15.24","rawR":"1Chr.15.24","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.15.24","value":"1Chr.15.24"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 15:24"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["2. One of the Levites who led the people in worship when Ezra read the law (",{"href":"?bref=Neh.9.4-5","r":"Neh.9.4-5","rawR":"Neh.9.4-5","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.9.4-5","value":"Neh.9.4-5"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 9:4-5"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["3. Head of a priestly family who set his seal on the covenant of Ezra (",{"href":"?bref=Neh.10.4","r":"Neh.10.4","rawR":"Neh.10.4","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.10.4","value":"Neh.10.4"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 10:4"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Neh.12.14","r":"Neh.12.14","rawR":"Neh.12.14","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.12.14","value":"Neh.12.14"}],"t":"ref","v":"12:14"},") and perhaps the same person as Shecaniah in ",{"href":"?bref=Neh.12.3","r":"Neh.12.3","rawR":"Neh.12.3","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.12.3","value":"Neh.12.3"}],"t":"ref","v":"Nehemiah 12:3"},". ",{"c":["See"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?item=ShecaniahShechaniah_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"ShecaniahShechaniah_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"ShecaniahShechaniah_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Shecaniah, Shechaniah #9"},"."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["4. Another Levite who set his seal on the covenant of Ezra (",{"href":"?bref=Neh.10.12","r":"Neh.10.12","rawR":"Neh.10.12","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.10.12","value":"Neh.10.12"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 10:12"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Shebaniah","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorTex